int_literal: a VACASK integer literal (dc=5, an `int` in VACASK) as a source value: ngspice has no integer literal, so legalize must convert it or refuse it
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
src (in 0) vsource dc=5
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
lower (out 0) resistor r=2k
control
  analysis op1 op
endc
